            options: ["Namtan Tipnaree", "Film Rachanun", "Aye Sarunchana", "Mook Worranit"],
            answer: "Namtan Tipnaree",
            fact: "Namtan（糖妹）演技極具爆發力，與 Film Rachanun 搭檔主演《Pluto 冥王星之戀》大受好評！"
        },
        {
